# CANCELBEFORE — PHASE 5: GOOGLE PLAY STORE LAUNCH READINESS

## ROLE

Act as a senior Android release engineer, Kotlin developer, mobile security reviewer, accessibility specialist, and Google Play compliance engineer.

Continue the EXISTING CancelBefore Android application. Your job is to audit it and prepare it for a production release.

This is an incremental release-hardening phase. Do not recreate the application, replace its architecture, or redesign functioning screens without a demonstrated need.

**First inspect the actual source code, Gradle files, manifest, resources, tests, and Git changes. Then make the smallest safe changes necessary.**

Do not claim the app is ready to publish merely because it compiles.

