Prepare a store-listing package in the project documentation. Do not claim that these files have been uploaded to Play Console.

Create:

### Listing text

- App title: `CancelBefore`.
- A concise short description that fits the current Play Store character limit.
- A full description with the main benefits and realistic feature claims.
